<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Kenai Voice</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Kenai Voice hjälper dig styra din vardag med röst. Hands-free, snabbt och byggt för creators." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#030712;
      --bg2:#0b1220;
      --panel:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      --panel-border:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --text:#f8fafc;
      --muted:#94a3b8;
      --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      --green-1:#22c55e;
      --green-2:#4ade80;
      --orange-1:#f97316;
      --orange-2:#fb923c;
      --blue-1:#3b82f6;
      --blue-2:#60a5fa;
      --shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      --radius:26px;
      --max:1100px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
    body{
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color:var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 50% -10%, rgba(59,130,246,.18), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(800px 400px at 50% 0%, rgba(99,102,241,.10), transparent 65%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg2), var(--bg));
      min-height:100vh;
    }

    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    .page{
      width:min(var(--max), calc(100% - 32px));
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:24px 0 90px;
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      padding:10px 12px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius:14px;
      box-shadow:none;
      margin-bottom:24px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      font-weight:700;
      letter-spacing:.01em;
      cursor:pointer;
      user-select:none;
    }

    .brand img{
      width:34px;
      height:34px;
      border-radius:999px;
      object-fit:cover;
      box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(56,189,248,.22);
      background:#0f172a;
      display:block;
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:22px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
    }

    .hero{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center;
      text-align:center;
      gap:14px;
      padding:20px 0 12px;
    }

    .hero-kicker{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      padding:8px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      color:#cbd5e1;
      font-size:12px;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    h1{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px);
      line-height:1.02;
      letter-spacing:-.035em;
    }

    .hero p{
      margin:0;
      max-width:760px;
      font-size:clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 24px);
      line-height:1.45;
      color:var(--muted);
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      justify-content:center;
      margin-top:6px;
    }

    .btn{
      padding:14px 22px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-weight:700;
      font-size:14px;
      letter-spacing:.01em;
      transition:transform .16s ease, box-shadow .16s ease, opacity .16s ease;
      border:1px solid transparent;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
    }

    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn-primary{
      background:#ffffff;
      color:#020617;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    }
    .btn-secondary{
      background:transparent;
      color:#94a3b8;
      border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .demo{
      margin:34px auto 62px;
      width:min(920px, 100%);
      min-height:430px;
      border-radius:32px;
      border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
      background:
        radial-gradient(700px 260px at 50% -10%, rgba(96,165,250,.14), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.06), rgba(255,255,255,.03));
      backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
      padding:26px;
    }

    .demo::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:20px;
      border-radius:24px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .demo-ui{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
      gap:22px;
      align-items:stretch;
      min-height:378px;
    }

    .demo-chat,
    .demo-phone{
      border-radius:24px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
      background:rgba(2,6,23,.42);
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .demo-topbar{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:12px;
      padding:14px 16px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    }

    .demo-dots{
      display:flex;
      gap:6px;
    }

    .demo-dots span{
      width:8px;
      height:8px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      display:block;
    }

    .demo-title{
      color:#dbeafe;
      font-size:13px;
      letter-spacing:.06em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .demo-chat-body{
      padding:18px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:14px;
    }

    .bubble{
      max-width:84%;
      padding:14px 16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.5;
    }

    .bubble-user{
      align-self:flex-start;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:#e5e7eb;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .bubble-ai{
      align-self:flex-end;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59,130,246,.22), rgba(96,165,250,.12));
      color:#f8fafc;
      border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,.20);
    }

    .demo-actions{
      margin-top:auto;
      display:flex;
      gap:10px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      padding:0 18px 18px;
    }

    .chip{
      padding:10px 12px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:13px;
      color:#cbd5e1;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .demo-phone{
      padding:18px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(96,165,250,.14), transparent 35%),
        rgba(2,6,23,.46);
    }

    .phone-shell{
      width:220px;
      height:340px;
      border-radius:34px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 28%, rgba(96,165,250,.22), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0f172a, #020617);
      box-shadow:
        0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35),
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      padding:18px 16px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
    }

    .phone-notch{
      width:84px;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      margin-top:2px;
    }

    .phone-core{
      width:112px;
      height:112px;
      border-radius:999px;
      position:relative;
      background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgba(96,165,250,.82), rgba(59,130,246,.14) 46%, rgba(255,255,255,.02) 70%);
      box-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(59,130,246,.22);
    }

    .phone-core::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.50);
    }

    .phone-core::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:50%;
      top:50%;
      width:14px;
      height:14px;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
      border-radius:999px;
      background:#7dd3fc;
      box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(125,211,252,.95);
    }

    .phone-lines{
      width:100%;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:10px;
      margin-top:12px;
    }

    .phone-lines span{
      display:block;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .phone-lines span:nth-child(1){ width:78%; }
    .phone-lines span:nth-child(2){ width:100%; }
    .phone-lines span:nth-child(3){ width:66%; }

    .phone-cta{
      width:100%;
      text-align:center;
      padding:11px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      color:#e2e8f0;
      font-size:13px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px){
      .demo-ui{
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .demo-phone{
        min-height:260px;
      }
      .phone-shell{
        width:200px;
        height:300px;
      }
    }

    .section-title{
      margin:0 0 24px;
      font-size:clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
      line-height:1.08;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .section-sub{
      margin:0 auto 36px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:720px;
      font-size:17px;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .cards{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap:22px;
      margin-bottom:72px;
    }

    .card{
      position:relative;
      padding:28px 24px 24px;
      border-radius:24px;
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      overflow:hidden;
      min-height:300px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      justify-content:flex-start;
    }

    .card::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.12), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .card > *{position:relative;z-index:1}

    .card-icon{
      width:72px;
      height:72px;
      border-radius:20px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      margin-bottom:18px;
      font-size:28px;
      font-weight:800;
    }

    .card-kicker{
      font-size:12px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      opacity:.82;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .card h3{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:28px;
      line-height:1.05;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
    }

    .card p{
      margin:0;
      font-size:16px;
      line-height:1.6;
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
    }

    .card-green{background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--green-2), var(--green-1))}
    .card-orange{background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--orange-2), var(--orange-1))}
    .card-blue{background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--blue-2), var(--blue-1))}

    .faq-wrap{
      margin:0 auto 74px;
      width:min(760px, 100%);
      padding:26px;
      border-radius:26px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .faq-item{
      padding:16px 4px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .faq-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
    .faq-q{
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:8px;
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .faq-a{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.6;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .contact{
      width:min(600px, 100%);
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:30px;
      border-radius:28px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .contact h2{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:34px;
      text-align:center;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
    }

    .contact p{
      margin:0 0 24px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .field{
      margin-bottom:14px;
    }

    .field input,
    .field textarea{
      width:100%;
      border:none;
      outline:none;
      padding:15px 16px;
      border-radius:14px;
      background:#fff;
      color:#111827;
      font:inherit;
    }

    .field textarea{
      min-height:120px;
      resize:vertical;
    }

    .submit{
      width:100%;
      border:none;
      padding:15px 18px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #e2e8f0);
      color:#020617;
      font-weight:800;
      font-size:15px;
      cursor:pointer;
    }

    .footer{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:center;
      margin-top:34px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
      padding:0 2px;
    }

    .footer-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:16px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px){
      .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:18px}
      .demo{min-height:300px}
      .footer{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start}
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px){
      .page{width:min(100% - 20px, var(--max)); padding-top:14px}
      .nav{padding:14px}
      .nav-links{gap:14px; font-size:13px}
      .hero{padding-top:18px}
      .demo{margin-top:26px; margin-bottom:46px; min-height:240px; border-radius:24px}
      .section-title{font-size:34px}
      .contact{padding:24px 18px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="brand" onclick="window.location.reload()" title="Refresh">
        <img src="kenai-coin-main.jpg" alt="Kenai logo" />
        <span>Kenai Voice</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#voice">Voice</a>
        <a href="#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="voice">
      <div class="hero-kicker" style="opacity:.7">voice AI</div>
      <h1>Kenai Voice</h1>
      <p>Control your world with voice. No hands. No friction.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Get Started</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#tools">See what Kenai can do</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="demo" aria-label="Kenai Voice preview">
      <div class="demo-ui">
        <div class="demo-chat">
          <div class="demo-topbar">
            <div class="demo-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="demo-title">Kenai Voice Demo</div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo-chat-body">
            <div class="bubble bubble-user">“Hey Kenai, summarize this meeting and pull out the action points.”</div>
            <div class="bubble bubble-ai">Summary ready. 3 key takeaways, 2 follow-ups, and a clean action list generated in seconds.</div>
            <div class="bubble bubble-user">“Now turn it into a short content outline.”</div>
            <div class="bubble bubble-ai">Done. Hook, 3 beats, payoff, and post caption structure prepared.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="demo-actions">
            <div class="chip">Voice capture</div>
            <div class="chip">AI summary</div>
            <div class="chip">Content flow</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="demo-phone">
          <div class="phone-shell">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="phone-core"></div>
            <div class="phone-lines">
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-cta">Hands-free mode active</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tools">
      <h2 class="section-title">Everything you can do with Kenai</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">One clean system for voice capture, reels, and timestamps. Same structure as your mockup — just designed to feel premium instead of placeholder.</p>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card card-green">
          <div class="card-icon">●</div>
          <div class="card-kicker">Recorder</div>
          <h3>Record</h3>
          <p>Capture voice notes, meetings, and ideas instantly, then turn them into usable AI summaries without friction.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card card-orange">
          <div class="card-icon">▲</div>
          <div class="card-kicker">Reels</div>
          <h3>Create</h3>
          <p>Turn raw media into short-form content faster with AI structure, hooks, pacing, and a cleaner path to publishable clips.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card card-blue">
          <div class="card-icon">✦</div>
          <div class="card-kicker">Timestamps</div>
          <h3>Navigate</h3>
          <p>Generate chapters, timestamps, and concise summaries so long audio and video become easier to scan and reuse.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-wrap">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">What platforms does Kenai Voice support?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Kenai Voice is designed around fast mobile-first usage and is built to feel lightweight, direct, and hands-free where possible.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">How do I get started?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Start with the core tools first: voice capture, reels, and timestamps. The goal is clarity and speed, not complexity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Why does this page feel cleaner than the Framer draft?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Because the layout stays the same, but the visual system is rebuilt with proper contrast, spacing, depth, and hierarchy.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <h2>Start using Kenai today</h2>
      <p>Want a clean AI workflow for voice and content? Send a message and build from here.</p>
      <div class="field"><input type="text" placeholder="Name" /></div>
      <div class="field"><input type="email" placeholder="Email" /></div>
      <div class="field"><textarea placeholder="Message"></textarea></div>
      <button class="submit">Get Started</button>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div>© Kenai Voice</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#voice">Voice</a>
        <a href="#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
